        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang unang bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa Noli Me Tangere. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 1 hanggang 5
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1783653999}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 537018496}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1527405150}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1527405150}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Ngayon, Bayani, haharapin mo ang panibagong yugto ng kamalayan.
            Dito mo makikilala sina Elias at Pilosopo Tasyo \u2014 mga tinig ng katotohanan
            na madalas balewalain. Matututuhan mong hindi lahat ng matalino ay nauunawaan,
            at hindi lahat ng boses ay pinakikinggan."
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1783653999}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 537018496}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1527405150}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: e5af32030f27ab442bef8dc382132486, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ito ang piging na inihanda ni Kapitan Tiago. Dito ipinakita ang agwat
            ng mayayaman at mahihirap, at kung paano nangingibabaw ang kapangyarihan
            ng mga prayle.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: bf96e199ddb88114f863fa2bc11721f8, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Dito lumilitaw ang tema ng reporma at pananagutan. Makikita si Ibarra
            na nagbabalak ng paaralan upang makatulong sa kabataan at magdala ng
            pagbabago sa San Diego
        - characterObj: {fileID: 8485366}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 00452319dc02d2e41aaaa8599c5e73a3, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Ang larawang ito ay sumisimbolo ng pagkakaisa at kooperasyon. Ang
            mga mamamayan ng San Diego, mayaman man o mahirap, ay nagtitulungan upang
            maisakatuparan ang proyekto ni Ibarra.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1783653999}
          direction: 0
